	"data": "Concept: Fiction & Worldbuilding (Estia's World)\n\nWhat It Is\nAn ongoing fictional universe cithoreal has been developing across dozens of journals. Magic school, spatial travel, named characters with detailed arcs. The worldbuilding is also a design space — mechanics from Thought Bubbles, skill trees, and spatial computing show up here first.\n\nCore Characters\nEstia — student at a magic school (Mishi's school). Medical track, finds it useful but not exciting. Developing sensing / energy-reading…",
